unciation":["살피다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c5e599b87cc90f56ed17.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.129,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=68307","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":142,"sequenceScore":2.7824,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["音响突然不能用了，能帮我看看吗？","好，我来检查一下。","你怎么知道我去教堂的？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["音响突然不能用了，能帮我看看吗？","好，我来检查一下。","你怎么知道我去教堂的？"],"answer":1}]}
